foldseq 1
title "The helmet base"
sheet "examples/helmet-base.fold"
anchor (3/4, 1/4)          # the middle of the south-east square, which no fold turns

step "Fold the square diagonally in half." { fold in front [corner south-west, corner north-east] moving corner north-west }
step "Bring the first doubled corner to the tip." { fold in front corner south-west to corner south-east }
step "Bring the other doubled corner to the tip: helmet base." { fold in front corner north-east to corner south-east }
